| desc = Applies the ability to both the primary and secondary targets.<br><br>If any of link instances are broken, {{H|Razor}} attacks the currently linked enemy unit.<br><br>Can be cast multiple times on the primary {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy, but not on the secondary affected unit.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Projectile|Linkbreak}}
** The link breaks in the following conditions:
*** Upon either Razor's or the affected enemy hero's {{M|death}}.
*** When either unit exceeds the {{Symbol|bonus cas}} link break distance.
**** The distance between both Razor and the affected enemy hero is checked before per attack damage loss interval.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#* Considers enemy {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}}, and {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes.
*#* Cannot be recast on the link-affected enemy unit, except ability interactions between {{M|Spell Redirection}} sources.
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Link}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|razor_static_link}}
*#* The ability effects has three components while linked to the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy:
*#** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#*** Grants {{#var:Static Link value2}} {{M|bonus attack damage}} and {{Symbol|bonus t4l}} bonus {{M|attack speed}} to Razor in 1-second intervals, starting 1 second after buff application.
*#** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|Attack Damage}}
*#*** Can attack the link-affected enemy while moving.
*#*** The ability orders Razor to attack the affected enemy upon cast, and upon each move order.
*#*** The ability effects may apply to different enemy units simutaneously, with Razor attacking the first {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy while moving.
*#*** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*#**** This does not changes Razor's {{M|facing angle}} while attacking, regardless of the {{M|attack animation}}.
*#**** The following orders causes Razor to not attack the affected enemy while moving:
*#***** {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} Unit-targeted orders.
*#***** {{Symbol|Target|Ground}} Ground-targeted orders.
*#***** Either the stop command or hold command with auto-attack options set to {{Code|◎ Never}}.
*#** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#*** Applies {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|razor_link_vision}} and grants Razor {{M|shared vision}} over the debuff-affected enemy unit.
*#*** {{A|Razor|Eye of the Storm}} prioritizes damaging link-affected enemy units with this debuff, regardless of its {{M|current health}} values.
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Link}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|razor_static_link_debuff}}
*#* Applies the following value reductions on the debuff-affected enemy unit in 1-second intervals, starting 1 second after debuff application:
*#** Both {{M|Main Attack Damage|text=main}} and {{M|bonus attack damage}}.
*#** The {{M|attack speed}} slow.
*#* All ability effects apply to link-affected enemy units of the following sources:
*#** {{M|Hidden}} sources.
*#** {{M|Invulnerable}} sources.
*# The following modifiers applied count down after the link duration ends:
*#* Hence, the ability bonuses granted on self, or values reductions applied on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targete enemy, are both active while linked and over the buff duration.
*#* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|razor_static_link_buff}}
*#* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|razor_static_link_debuff}}
*#** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|razor_link_vision}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Static Link icon0}}
| desc = Creates a charged link between Razor and an enemy Hero, stealing damage from the target and giving it to Razor. Allows Razor to attack while moving with the link active.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Grants a max of {{calc|v1*{{#var:Static Link value4}}|v1={{#var:Static Link value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t2r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Static Link value4}}|v1={{#var:Static Link value2 tal}}}}|15tal}}) flat {{M|bonus attack damage}} and {{ValueColor||attack speed|25tal}} while reducing the target's over its duration.

* For {{M|melee}} units, if the enemy target is {{G|melee miss range}} range farther than the attacker's range, the attack will {{M|miss}} regardless.

